            "id": 88362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple'ları, diğer tüm değerler gibi bir listede depolayabiliriz; burada da oyuncuları ve puanlarını içeren tuple'lar bulunuyor.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[('mia', 75), ('lee', 90)]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>(\"mia\", 75), (\"lee\", 90)</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir liste demetleri barındırabilir. Her oyuncuyu puanıyla eşleştirip <code>[('mia', 75), ('lee', 90)]</code> yazdırması için <code>scores</code> listesini doldur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;mia&quot;, 75], [&quot;lee&quot;, 90]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[('mia', 75), ('lee', 90)]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>(\"mia\", 75), (\"lee\", 90)</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
