            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listedeki belirli bir demete, ilk demet için burada <code>scores[0]</code> kullanıldığı gibi, diziniyle erişebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"51\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('mia', 75)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>scores[0]</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
