            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple'a eriştikten sonra onu <code>mia_score</code> gibi bir değişkene kaydedebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mia_score = scores[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(mia_score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"('mia', 75)\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>mia_score</code>, ardından <code>=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
